&lt;h2 id="效果图"&gt;效果图
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://keyboard2005.github.io/posts/2025/03-22/ubuntu24%E5%A4%9A%E6%98%BE%E7%A4%BA%E5%99%A8%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E5%A3%81%E7%BA%B8/images/1.png"
